guide butler-routes-completionist/dustwallow-horde
title Dustwallow Marsh (Horde)
levels 30-45
zone Dustwallow Marsh
faction Horde
category Leveling
folder Completionist
keywords dustwallow, horde, brackenwall
coords live
version 1

# Brackenwall Village holds the Horde side: Nazeer Bloodpike's command
# (Nazeer, Krak, Ogron, Krog), Stinky Ignatz's escape and Bogbean leaves,
# the raptor-hide work, then the Loose Dirt south and the expedition leg
# for the chain that leaves the zone (Barrens escort to Mebok).
# Every Horde accept in the local census (5 quests,
# docs/dustwallow-horde-census.md) appears exactly once as an accept and
# once as a turn-in. Completes for quests whose blocking pre-quest sits
# outside the contract ride in dedicated `when onquest` mini-steps, never
# inline in a route step. Coordinates on Dustwallow use the era frame;
# expedition stops use the era frame too, set with zone map lines. The
# Alliance side belongs to the main guide.

step Brackenwall - mustering

  zone map 1445

  tip Brackenwall Village: Nazeer Bloodpike (35.21, 30.66) holds the command, Krak (36.4, 30.85) works the pens, Ogron (40.96, 36.69) watches the yard, Krog (36.42, 31.88) runs the point.
  accept 1273 -- Questioning Reethe - Ogron; Paval Reethe, the compound
  note 1273's pre (1269 Barrens, uncontracted here) fills outside this route - take 1273 here; its questioning leg runs in the mini below. The Badge that starts 1269 sits at (29.83, 48.24) if you pass it.
  accept 1270 -- Stinky's Escape - Stinky Ignatz (46.88, 17.52); Bogbean leaves, then Mebok takes it in the Barrens, late
  note 1270's Bogbean patch sits north-east of Stinky - work it on the way out.
  accept 98192 -- Skin Careful, Skin Sharp - Krak; raptor hides, the bloodfen
  accept 1238 -- The Lost Report - the Loose Dirt (55.44, 25.92); Nazeer takes it here
  note 1238's starter (the Dirt) sits south - take it on the south pass below.

step Stinky's Bogbean leaves - the escort east

  zone map 1445

  complete 1270 @48.87,24.58 era -- Bogbean leaves for Stinky Ignatz

step The south dirt - the lost report

  zone map 1445

  goto 55.44,25.92 era
  accept 1238 -- The Lost Report - the Loose Dirt; Nazeer takes it at Brackenwall
  turnin 1238 -- The Lost Report - the report to Nazeer Bloodpike
  note 1239's pre (1238 above) fills here - take 1239 after it.
  accept 1239 -- The Severed Head - the Loose Dirt; Nazeer takes it at Brackenwall
  turnin 1239 -- The Severed Head - the head to Nazeer Bloodpike
  note 1239's chain runs on into the Barrens (1240 Troll Witchdoctor, uncontracted anywhere) - named as the exit, never accepted here.

step The bloodfen - raptor hides

  zone map 1445

  collect 279601 x8 quest 98192.1 @31.73,65.71 era -- Intact Raptor Hides off the Bloodfen Razormaw for Krak
  turnin 98192 -- Skin Careful, Skin Sharp - the hides to Krak

step Ogron's questioning - Reethe's turn

  when onquest 1269

  zone map 1445

  complete 1273 @42.65,38.07 era -- Paval Reethe for Ogron
  complete 1273 @42.47,38.07 era -- Question Reethe with Ogron, at the compound
  turnin 1273 -- Questioning Reethe - Reethe's word to Krog

step Expedition - Barrens, Mebok's word

  zone map 1413

  turnin 1270 -- Stinky's Escape - Stinky's word to Mebok Mizzyrix
  note The escort crosses the zone line - Stinky walks it with you; the turn-in sits at (62.37, 37.62).
  zone map 1445

step Dustwallow - done

  note Brackenwall holds: the report delivered, the head severed, Stinky escaped, Reethe questioned, the hides skinned. The Alliance side belongs to the main guide.
